&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Timeline, a team project planner with a fast canvas Gantt view&lt;/b&gt; — New or updated LLM releases affect tool choices across your entire stack — from IDE copilots to pipeline automation. &lt;a href="https://github.com/vakahnke/Timeline"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
