&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Free GitHub Action that scans PR diffs for malicious code, not quality&lt;/b&gt; — Community-vetted signal from Hacker News — high upvote-to-age ratio means the engineering community found it worth reading. &lt;a href="https://github.com/marketplace/actions/vigil-pr-scanner"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
